<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>{{frameworkName}} Check Expiry Warning - {{clubName}}</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #333;
      background-color: #f4f4f4;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 20px auto;
      background: #fff;
      border-radius: 8px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    }
    .header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #EF4444 0%, #DC2626 100%);
      color: #fff;
      padding: 35px 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .header h1 {
      margin: 0 0 8px 0;
      font-size: 26px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .header .warning-icon {
      font-size: 48px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .header p {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 15px;
      opacity: 0.95;
    }
    .content {
      padding: 30px 20px;
    }
    .urgency-banner {
      background: #FEF2F2;
      border: 2px solid #FCA5A5;
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 20px;
      margin: 25px 0;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .urgency-banner h2 {
      margin: 0 0 8px 0;
      font-size: 20px;
      color: #DC2626;
    }
    .urgency-banner p {
      margin: 0;
      color: #991B1B;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .dbs-details {
      background: #F8FAFC;
      border-left: 4px solid #EF4444;
      padding: 20px;
      margin: 25px 0;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }
    .dbs-details h3 {
      margin: 0 0 15px 0;
      font-size: 16px;
      color: #1E293B;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .detail-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 10px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
    }
    .detail-row:last-child {
      border-bottom: none;
    }
    .detail-label {
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #64748B;
    }
    .detail-value {
      color: #1E293B;
      font-weight: 500;
    }
    .expiry-date {
      font-size: 18px;
      color: #DC2626;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .action-required {
      background: #FEF3C7;
      border-left: 4px solid #F59E0B;
      padding: 20px;
      margin: 25px 0;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }
    .action-required h3 {
      margin: 0 0 12px 0;
      font-size: 18px;
      color: #D97706;
    }
    .action-required ol {
      margin: 10px 0;
      padding-left: 20px;
      color: #78350F;
    }
    .action-required li {
      margin: 8px 0;
    }
    .consequences {
      background: #FEF2F2;
      padding: 16px;
      margin: 20px 0;
      border-radius: 4px;
      border: 1px solid #FECACA;
    }
    .consequences p {
      margin: 0;
      color: #7F1D1D;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .consequences strong {
      color: #991B1B;
    }
    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #EF4444;
      color: #fff;
      padding: 14px 32px;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin: 20px 0;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .button:hover {
      background: #DC2626;
    }
    .button-container {
      text-align: center;
      margin: 30px 0;
    }
    .footer {
      background: #F8FAFC;
      padding: 20px;
      text-align: center;
      color: #64748B;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .footer p {
      margin: 5px 0;
    }
    .footer a {
      color: #EF4444;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <div class="warning-icon">⚠️</div>
      <h1>{{frameworkName}} Check Expiring Soon</h1>
      <p>Urgent Action Required</p>
    </div>

    <div class="content">
      <p>Dear {{firstName}} {{lastName}},</p>

      <p>This is an important notification regarding your {{frameworkName}}{{#if showUpdateService}} (Disclosure and Barring Service){{/if}} check with {{clubName}}.</p>

      <div class="urgency-banner">
        <h2>Your {{frameworkName}} Check Expires in {{daysUntilExpiry}} Days</h2>
        <p>Immediate action is required to maintain your clearance</p>
      </div>

      <div class="dbs-details">
        <h3>{{frameworkName}} Check Details</h3>
        <div class="detail-row">
          <span class="detail-label">{{certificateNumberLabel}}:</span>
          <span class="detail-value">{{certificateNumber}}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="detail-row">
          <span class="detail-label">Check Type:</span>
          <span class="detail-value">{{checkType}}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="detail-row">
          <span class="detail-label">Issue Date:</span>
          <span class="detail-value">{{issueDate}}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="detail-row">
          <span class="detail-label">Expiry Date:</span>
          <span class="detail-value expiry-date">{{expiryDate}}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="detail-row">
          <span class="detail-label">Current Status:</span>
          <span class="detail-value" style="color: #F59E0B; font-weight: 700;">⚠️ Expiring Soon</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="action-required">
        <h3>Required Actions</h3>
        <ol>
          {{#if showUpdateService}}
          <li><strong>Apply for a new DBS check immediately</strong> via the DBS Update Service or through {{clubName}}</li>
          {{else}}
          <li><strong>Apply for a new {{frameworkName}} check immediately</strong> through {{clubName}}</li>
          {{/if}}
          <li><strong>Provide the new certificate number</strong> to our compliance officer as soon as it's issued</li>
          <li><strong>Keep your current certificate</strong> accessible for verification if needed</li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <div class="consequences">
        <p><strong>Important:</strong> If your {{frameworkName}} check expires without renewal, you will not be permitted to work with children or vulnerable adults until a new valid check is in place, in accordance with {{safeguardingFramework}} safeguarding requirements.</p>
      </div>

      {{#if renewalUrl}}
      <div class="button-container">
        <a href="{{renewalUrl}}" class="button">Renew {{frameworkName}} Check</a>
      </div>
      {{/if}}

      <p style="margin-top: 30px;"><strong>Need Assistance?</strong></p>
      <p>If you need help with the renewal process or have any questions, please contact our safeguarding team immediately:</p>
      <ul style="margin-top: 10px;">
        <li>Email: safeguarding@{{clubDomain}}</li>
        {{#if contactNumber}}
        <li>Phone: {{contactNumber}}</li>
        {{/if}}
      </ul>

      <p style="margin-top: 25px;">Thank you for your prompt attention to this matter.</p>

      <p style="margin-top: 20px;">
        Best regards,<br>
        <strong>{{clubName}} Compliance Team</strong>
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      <p>&copy; {{year}} {{clubName}}. All rights reserved.</p>
      <p>This is a mandatory safeguarding notification. <a href="{{supportUrl}}">Contact Support</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
